<article class="Page SectionPage">
    


    <div class="Page__wrapper">
        
<div id="8f82922f"><ol class="jIjgn7qoTMH3b4e0jW3j" id="breadcrumbs"><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/">Kristiania</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/for-studenter/">For studenter</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/">Utveksling</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46" href="/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/internasjonale-samarbeidspartnere/">Internasjonale samarbeidspartnere</a></li><li><a class="QqohSkg5NSBKEgLCAL46">Tyskland</a></li></ol><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['8f82922f-json'] = {"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Kristiania","link":"/"},{"name":"For studenter","link":"/for-studenter/"},{"name":"Utveksling","link":"/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/"},{"name":"Internasjonale samarbeidspartnere","link":"/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/internasjonale-samarbeidspartnere/"},{"name":"Tyskland","link":null}]};</script></div>
        <div class="Page__header">
            <h1 class="Page__title">
Tyskland
</h1>
                <div class="Page__intro">
<p>Her finner du informasjon om våre samarbeidspartnere i Tyskland.</p>
</div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="Page__body">
        <div class="Richtext Richtext--wide">
            
<div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content"><p>Merk at semesteret i Tyskland ofte er annerledes organisert enn i Norge, ofte med et "vintersemester" f.eks. fra primo oktober til ultimo februar; og "sommersemester" fra mars til ultimo juli.&nbsp;</p>
<p><strong>Gå direkte til:</strong></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="#Aalen">Aalen Hochschule</a></li>
<li><a href="#CBS">CBS International Business School</a>&nbsp;</li>
<li><a href="#Cologne">Cologne University of Applied Sciences</a>&nbsp;(Köln)</li>
<li><a href="#beruf">Duale Hochschule Sachsen</a></li>
<li><a href="#Folkwang">Folkwang Universität der Künste</a></li>
<li><a href="#FrankfurtUAS">Frankfurt University of Applied Sciences</a></li>
<li><a href="#Heidelberg">Heidelberg University</a></li>
<li><a href="#dussel">Hochschule Düsseldorf</a></li>
<li><a href="#MusikTanz">Hochschule für Musik und Tanz, Köln</a></li>
<li><a href="#HMTMH">Hochschule für Musik, Theater und Medien Hannover</a></li>
<li><a href="#ISoM">International School of Management<span>&nbsp;</span></a>(Dortmund, Frankfurt og Köln)</li>
<li><a href="#student">International School of Management</a> (Studentintervju)</li>
<li><a href="#media">Media University of Applied Sciences</a></li>
<li><a href="#Muthesius">Muthesius University in Kiel</a></li>
<li><a href="#Peter">Peter Behrens School of Arts</a>&nbsp;(Dusseldorf)</li>
<li><a href="#SRH">SRH Berlin University of Applied Sciences</a></li>
<li><a href="#potsdam">University of Potsdam</a></li>
<li><a href="#Witten"><span>Witten/Herdecke University</span></a></li>
</ul>
<p><span><a id="Aalen"></a></span></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="4420fbad"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/e41db1a537a24fe696053ae66c46c3b6/csm_01_18.06.2025_12_284f06bbd7.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/e41db1a537a24fe696053ae66c46c3b6/csm_01_18.06.2025_12_284f06bbd7.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/e41db1a537a24fe696053ae66c46c3b6/csm_01_18.06.2025_12_284f06bbd7.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/e41db1a537a24fe696053ae66c46c3b6/csm_01_18.06.2025_12_284f06bbd7.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Aalen Hochschule</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.hs-aalen.de/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Aalen Hochschule</a><a href="https://www.hs-aalen.de/en/"></a>&nbsp;ligger i <a href="https://www.bing.com/maps?q=Hochschule+Aalen+Germany&amp;cp=48.8374~10.0933&amp;lvl=13" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Aalen, Baden-Württemberg</a>, en mindre by i nærheten av Stuttgart, med god togforbindelse til regionen. Hovedundervisningsspråket er tysk, men det finnes engelskspråklige emnepakker innen blant annet business, innovasjon og IT.<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DlUVmXrkbgU" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Reklamefilm</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.hs-aalen.de/en/application-studying/life-on-campus/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Studentlivet på Aalen</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.hs-aalen.de/en/international-center/exchange-studies-in-aalen/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside for internasjonale studenter</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.service4mobility.com/europe/PortalServlet?identifier=AALEN01&amp;kz_bew_pers=S&amp;kz_bew_art=IN&amp;preselectTab=courses_pers_semester&amp;showAll=0&amp;showPartner=0&amp;sprache=en&amp;is_hide_map=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Oversikt engelskspråklige emner</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Aalen er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Vintersemesteret går fra september - februar<br>- Sommersemesteret går fra mars - august</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['4420fbad-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/e41db1a537a24fe696053ae66c46c3b6/csm_01_18.06.2025_12_284f06bbd7.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Aalen Hochschule","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.hs-aalen.de/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Aalen Hochschule</a><a href=\"https://www.hs-aalen.de/en/\"></a>&nbsp;ligger i <a href=\"https://www.bing.com/maps?q=Hochschule+Aalen+Germany&amp;cp=48.8374~10.0933&amp;lvl=13\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Aalen, Baden-W&uuml;rttemberg</a>, en mindre by i n&aelig;rheten av Stuttgart, med god togforbindelse til regionen. Hovedundervisningsspr&aring;ket er tysk, men det finnes engelskspr&aring;klige emnepakker innen blant annet business, innovasjon og IT.</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DlUVmXrkbgU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reklamefilm</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hs-aalen.de/en/application-studying/life-on-campus/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Studentlivet p&aring; Aalen</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hs-aalen.de/en/international-center/exchange-studies-in-aalen/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside for internasjonale studenter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.service4mobility.com/europe/PortalServlet?identifier=AALEN01&amp;kz_bew_pers=S&amp;kz_bew_art=IN&amp;preselectTab=courses_pers_semester&amp;showAll=0&amp;showPartner=0&amp;sprache=en&amp;is_hide_map=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Oversikt engelskspr&aring;klige emner</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Aalen er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- Vintersemesteret g&aring;r fra september - februar<br />- Sommersemesteret g&aring;r fra mars - august</p>\n<p>&nbsp;"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="CBS"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="61d55a4a"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/a53a3f1b7b5e46b8854a724dc2daecfa/potsdam2022-5395.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/a53a3f1b7b5e46b8854a724dc2daecfa/potsdam2022-5395.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/a53a3f1b7b5e46b8854a724dc2daecfa/potsdam2022-5395.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/a53a3f1b7b5e46b8854a724dc2daecfa/potsdam2022-5395.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">CBS International Business School</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.cbs.de/en/locations/campus-potsdam">CBS International Business School</a> er en institusjon med utdanning innen internasjonal business og med en emnepakke som passer for studenter med interesse for økonomi, ledelse, markedsføring og forretningsutvikling. Vi har en avtale med campus i Köln, som er et helt nytt campus i 2024 tilrettelagt for alle utveklingsstudenter! I Köln vil du være blandt over én million innbyggere og nesten 100,000 studenter.<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.cbs.de/en/bachelors-degree-germany/international-business/">Praktisk informasjon om studiet der HK studenter følger 4. semester</a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/a53a3f1b7b5e46b8854a724dc2daecfa/cbs_fact_sheet_2025-26_campus_cologne.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Factsheet 25/26</a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/a53a3f1b7b5e46b8854a724dc2daecfa/study_abroad_at_cbs.pdf">Student handbook</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved CBS er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra september - desember<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra mars - juni</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['61d55a4a-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/a53a3f1b7b5e46b8854a724dc2daecfa/potsdam2022-5395.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"CBS International Business School","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.cbs.de/en/locations/campus-potsdam\">CBS International Business School</a> er en institusjon med utdanning innen internasjonal business og med en emnepakke som passer for studenter med interesse for &oslash;konomi, ledelse, markedsf&oslash;ring og forretningsutvikling. Vi har en avtale med campus i K&ouml;ln, som er et helt nytt campus i 2024 tilrettelagt for alle utveklingsstudenter! I K&ouml;ln vil du v&aelig;re blandt over &eacute;n million innbyggere og nesten 100,000 studenter.</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.cbs.de/en/bachelors-degree-germany/international-business/\">Praktisk informasjon om studiet der HK studenter f&oslash;lger 4. semester</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/a53a3f1b7b5e46b8854a724dc2daecfa/cbs_fact_sheet_2025-26_campus_cologne.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Factsheet 25/26</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/a53a3f1b7b5e46b8854a724dc2daecfa/study_abroad_at_cbs.pdf\">Student handbook</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved CBS er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra september - desember<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra mars - juni"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="Cologne"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="71f70872"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/95812168f97b487c9dd8ef0c58d8e26c/cuas-cologne-0b19ca24d6.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/95812168f97b487c9dd8ef0c58d8e26c/cuas-cologne-0b19ca24d6.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/95812168f97b487c9dd8ef0c58d8e26c/cuas-cologne-0b19ca24d6.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/95812168f97b487c9dd8ef0c58d8e26c/cuas-cologne-0b19ca24d6.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Cologne University of Applied Sciences</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.th-koeln.de/en/homepage_26.php">TH Köln, Cologne University of Applied Sciences</a>, er blant Tysklands største tekniske høyskoler, med flere campuser i og rundt Köln. Universitetet huser omtrent 21,000 studenter fra 120 forskjellige land.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="/contentassets/95812168f97b487c9dd8ef0c58d8e26c/fact_sheet_th_koeln_march_2026_2.0.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Factsheet TH Köln</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.th-koeln.de/en/international_office/cologne-game-lab_55745.php">Emner ved Köln Game Lab</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.th-koeln.de/en/international_office/koeln-international-school-of-design_55760.php">Emner ved Köln Interntional School of Design</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.th-koeln.de/en/international_office/exchange-students_21380.php">Generell info for innkommende studener til TH Köln</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Cologne University er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Vintersemesteret går fra september - februar<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra mars - august</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['71f70872-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/95812168f97b487c9dd8ef0c58d8e26c/cuas-cologne-0b19ca24d6.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Cologne University of Applied Sciences","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.th-koeln.de/en/homepage_26.php\">TH K&ouml;ln, Cologne University of Applied Sciences</a>, er blant Tysklands st&oslash;rste tekniske h&oslash;yskoler, med flere campuser i og rundt K&ouml;ln. Universitetet huser omtrent 21,000 studenter fra 120 forskjellige land.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/95812168f97b487c9dd8ef0c58d8e26c/fact_sheet_th_koeln_march_2026_2.0.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Factsheet TH K&ouml;ln</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.th-koeln.de/en/international_office/cologne-game-lab_55745.php\">Emner ved K&ouml;ln Game Lab</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.th-koeln.de/en/international_office/koeln-international-school-of-design_55760.php\">Emner ved K&ouml;ln Interntional School of Design</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.th-koeln.de/en/international_office/exchange-students_21380.php\">Generell info for innkommende studener til TH K&ouml;ln</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Cologne University er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- Vintersemesteret g&aring;r fra september - februar<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra mars - august"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="beruf"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="6d31131d"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/06a5246ca5e54fc682c6197e8333322d/staatliche-studienakademie-breitenbrunn.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/06a5246ca5e54fc682c6197e8333322d/staatliche-studienakademie-breitenbrunn.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/06a5246ca5e54fc682c6197e8333322d/staatliche-studienakademie-breitenbrunn.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/06a5246ca5e54fc682c6197e8333322d/staatliche-studienakademie-breitenbrunn.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Duale Hochschule Sachsen (Berufsakademie)</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://sachsen.ba-sn.de/en/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Duale Hochschule Sachsen (Berufsakademie)</a>&nbsp;er et utdanningsinstitutt med flere campus i den historiske og kulturelt rike regionen Sachsen, Tyskland. Skolen tilbyr relevante emner for Kristiania studenter innen økonomi, forretning og audiovisuelt innhold.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://sachsen.ba-sn.de/en/berufsakademie-sachsen/internationalization/incoming" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside incoming students</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterene kan skreddersys for innvekslingsstudenter, slik at de dermed kan gå fra:<br>- Høstsemesteret: august - desember<br>- Vårsemesteret: januar - mai/juni</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['6d31131d-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/06a5246ca5e54fc682c6197e8333322d/staatliche-studienakademie-breitenbrunn.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Duale Hochschule Sachsen (Berufsakademie)","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://sachsen.ba-sn.de/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Duale Hochschule Sachsen (Berufsakademie)</a>&nbsp;er et utdanningsinstitutt med flere campus i den historiske og kulturelt rike regionen Sachsen, Tyskland. Skolen tilbyr relevante emner for Kristiania studenter innen &oslash;konomi, forretning og audiovisuelt innhold.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://sachsen.ba-sn.de/en/berufsakademie-sachsen/internationalization/incoming\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside incoming students</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterene kan skreddersys for innvekslingsstudenter, slik at de dermed kan g&aring; fra:<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret: august - desember<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret: januar - mai/juni"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
