</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Frankfurt University er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Vintersemesteret går fra oktober - februar<br>- Sommersemesteret går fra mars - juli</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['d93d76c2-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/f710932aa1ca4ed3a1bd05d4fb87e875/frankfurt.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Frankfurt University of Applied Sciences","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.frankfurt-university.de/en/\">Frankfurt University of Applied Sciences</a> har emner innen flere tekniske fag, bl.a. informasjonsteknologi.</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/f710932aa1ca4ed3a1bd05d4fb87e875/fact-sheet_2020_21-uas-frankfurt.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fact Sheet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.frankfurt-university.de/en/studies/international-office/incomings/exchange/\">Emnekatalog</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.frankfurt-university.de/en/studies/international-office/incomings/exchange/academic-calendar/\">Akademisk kalender</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.frankfurt-university.de/en/studies/international-office/incomings/exchange/\">For innkommende studenter</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Frankfurt University er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- Vintersemesteret g&aring;r fra oktober - februar<br />- Sommersemesteret g&aring;r fra mars - juli"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
