<li><a href="https://www.hs-duesseldorf.de/prospectivestudents/degreeseekings/faq" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FAQ</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved HSD er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Sommersemesteret går fra mars - juli<br>- Vintersemesteret går fra september - februar</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['180e9dff-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/e23d436ec2bd4311bc69ff27cc38ac85/startseite_kreis_en.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Hochschule Düsseldorf","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.hs-duesseldorf.de/prospectivestudents/exchangestudents\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hochschule D&uuml;sseldorf (HSD)</a> er et offentlig universitet for anvendt vitenskap, etablert i 1971 og lokalisert i D&uuml;sseldorf, Tyskland.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hs-duesseldorf.de/prospectivestudents/exchangestudents\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside kommende studenter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hs-duesseldorf.de/erasmusplus-studium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside Erasmus+ (tysk)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/e23d436ec2bd4311bc69ff27cc38ac85/hsd-information_sheet_2026_27.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Info sheet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hs-duesseldorf.de/prospectivestudents/degreeseekings/faq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FAQ</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved HSD er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- Sommersemesteret g&aring;r fra mars - juli<br />- Vintersemesteret g&aring;r fra september - februar"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
