<p><a id="potsdam"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="47765add"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/16df2ef5b84a4227ab8ce7754e9c09ba/csm_campus_am_neuen_palais_foto_karla_fritze_02787532c7.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/16df2ef5b84a4227ab8ce7754e9c09ba/csm_campus_am_neuen_palais_foto_karla_fritze_02787532c7.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/16df2ef5b84a4227ab8ce7754e9c09ba/csm_campus_am_neuen_palais_foto_karla_fritze_02787532c7.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/16df2ef5b84a4227ab8ce7754e9c09ba/csm_campus_am_neuen_palais_foto_karla_fritze_02787532c7.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">University of Potsdam</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.uni-potsdam.de/en/university-of-potsdam" target="_blank" rel="noopener">University of Potsdam</a> er et offentlig universitet etablert i 1991, og er blant Tysklands yngre universiteter. Universitetet har flere campuser, inkludert det historiske Neues Palais i Sanssouci-parken.&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.uni-potsdam.de/en/international/incoming/international-students/exchange" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside internasjonal mobilitet</a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/16df2ef5b84a4227ab8ce7754e9c09ba/factsheet_2024_25.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fact sheet</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.uni-potsdam.de/en/studium/dates-and-deadlines/important-dates-and-deadlines-during-your-studies" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Akademisk kalender</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved universitetet er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Vintersemesteret går fra oktober - mars<br>- Sommersemesteret går fra april - august</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['47765add-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/16df2ef5b84a4227ab8ce7754e9c09ba/csm_campus_am_neuen_palais_foto_karla_fritze_02787532c7.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"University of Potsdam","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.uni-potsdam.de/en/university-of-potsdam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">University of Potsdam</a> er et offentlig universitet etablert i 1991, og er blant Tysklands yngre universiteter. Universitetet har flere campuser, inkludert det historiske Neues Palais i Sanssouci-parken.&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.uni-potsdam.de/en/international/incoming/international-students/exchange\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside internasjonal mobilitet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/16df2ef5b84a4227ab8ce7754e9c09ba/factsheet_2024_25.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fact sheet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.uni-potsdam.de/en/studium/dates-and-deadlines/important-dates-and-deadlines-during-your-studies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Akademisk kalender</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved universitetet er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- Vintersemesteret g&aring;r fra oktober - mars<br />- Sommersemesteret g&aring;r fra april - august"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
