<p><a id="Witten"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="3bc1ab0a"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/8a7972b5b4bb467ba33a18b030f4fbb6/uni_aussen_luftbild.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/8a7972b5b4bb467ba33a18b030f4fbb6/uni_aussen_luftbild.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/8a7972b5b4bb467ba33a18b030f4fbb6/uni_aussen_luftbild.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/8a7972b5b4bb467ba33a18b030f4fbb6/uni_aussen_luftbild.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Witten/Herdecke University</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.uni-wh.de/en/uwh-international/start/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Witten/Herdecke University</a> er et privat universitet beliggende i Witten, Tyskland. Universitetet tilbyr engelsk undervisning i bachelor- og mastergrader for business management, økonomi og PPE.<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.uni-wh.de/en/uwh-international/incoming-students/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside for internasjonale studenter</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.uni-wh.de/en/uwh-international/university/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside om universitetet</a></li>
<li><a href="/contentassets/8a7972b5b4bb467ba33a18b030f4fbb6/uwh_fact_sheet_01.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Fact sheet 2023/2024</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved <span>universitetet er som følger<br>- Vintersemesteret går fra oktober - mars<br>- Sommersemesteret går fra april - september</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['3bc1ab0a-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/8a7972b5b4bb467ba33a18b030f4fbb6/uni_aussen_luftbild.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Witten/Herdecke University","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.uni-wh.de/en/uwh-international/start/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Witten/Herdecke University</a> er et privat universitet beliggende i Witten, Tyskland. Universitetet tilbyr engelsk undervisning i bachelor- og mastergrader for business management, &oslash;konomi og PPE.</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.uni-wh.de/en/uwh-international/incoming-students/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside for internasjonale studenter</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.uni-wh.de/en/uwh-international/university/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside om universitetet</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/contentassets/8a7972b5b4bb467ba33a18b030f4fbb6/uwh_fact_sheet_01.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Fact sheet 2023/2024</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved <span>universitetet er som f&oslash;lger<br />- Vintersemesteret g&aring;r fra oktober - mars<br />- Sommersemesteret g&aring;r fra april - september</span>"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
